{"seq":3,"slug":"quickresponse-leadtime-cut","title":"快反周期压缩与并行准备","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/agile-quickresponse-supply-chain/small-batch-quick-response/quickresponse-leadtime-cut","wordCount":2100,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"快反周期压缩与并行准备\">快反周期压缩与并行准备</h1><p>前两节分别处理了「追不追」和「追多少」，这一节处理「为什么快不起来」。当一个款的交期承诺是 20 天、但业务方要求 10 天时，感性的反应是催工厂加班。这种做法在加工时间上能挤出的空间通常很小，因为服装加工的纯作业时间只占整个周期的一小部分。真正的空间藏在<strong>周期结构</strong>里——那些既不是加工、也不是运输，而是「在等」的时间。这一节把交期拆开，找到可压缩的那部分，并给出并行准备的具体做法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-交期的时间构成\">核心概念：交期的时间构成</h2><p>一个订单从下达到入库的总周期，可以粗分为四块：<strong>准备时间</strong>（打样确认、面料到位、技术包下发）、<strong>排队时间</strong>（工单等机台、等物料、等上道工序）、<strong>加工时间</strong>（裁、缝、后道、整烫、包装的实际作业）、<strong>流转时间</strong>（厂内搬运、外协往返、出货运输）。多数平台的交期讨论只盯着加工时间，而加工时间在服装里往往只占总周期的 20%–30%。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时间块</th>\n<th>典型占比</th>\n<th>可压缩性</th>\n<th>主要手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>准备时间</td>\n<td>20%–40%</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>并行化、面料前置、配方预置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排队时间</td>\n<td>20%–40%</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>控制投料节奏、减少在制品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加工时间</td>\n<td>20%–30%</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>工艺改善、设备升级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流转时间</td>\n<td>10%–20%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>布局优化、外协就近、拼车</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表最反直觉的一行是「排队时间与准备时间合计常超过加工时间」。它意味着交期压缩的主战场不在车间，而在<strong>排产与协同</strong>。一个平台即使不改变任何加工工艺，只靠压缩准备与排队，就能把总周期砍掉三分之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"排队时间与在制品\">排队时间与在制品</h2><p>排队时间不是随机的，它由系统的在制品水平决定。Little&#39;s Law 给出了三者之间的定量关系：系统中的平均在制品量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>、产出率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>、平均周期时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>在制造场景里它写作「前置时间 = 在制品 ÷ 产出率」（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Little%27s_law\">Wikipedia: Little&#39;s law</a>）。这条式子的用途是判断瓶颈所在：如果一个车间的产出率是每天 1000 件、在制品有 3000 件，那么平均每件要待 3 天，其中加工时间可能只有半天，其余都在排队。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[车间在制品 3000 件] --&gt; B[产出率 1000 件/天]&#10;  B --&gt; C[平均周期 3 天]&#10;  C --&gt; D[其中加工 0.5 天]&#10;  C --&gt; E[其中排队 2.5 天]&#10;  E --&gt; F{降低在制品的做法}&#10;  F --&gt; G[按节拍投料]&#10;  F --&gt; H[限制在制品上限]&#10;  F --&gt; I[缩短换款以支持小批流转]&#10;  G --&gt; J[周期缩短至 1.2 天]&#10;  H --&gt; J&#10;  I --&gt; J\">graph TD\n  A[车间在制品 3000 件] --&gt; B[产出率 1000 件/天]\n  B --&gt; C[平均周期 3 天]\n  C --&gt; D[其中加工 0.5 天]\n  C --&gt; E[其中排队 2.5 天]\n  E --&gt; F{降低在制品的做法}\n  F --&gt; G[按节拍投料]\n  F --&gt; H[限制在制品上限]\n  F --&gt; I[缩短换款以支持小批流转]\n  G --&gt; J[周期缩短至 1.2 天]\n  H --&gt; J\n  I --&gt; J</pre><p>关键的推论是：<strong>在制品翻倍会让周期时间翻倍，但不会让产出增加</strong>。产出率受制于瓶颈工序的能力，投更多料只会让在制品堆积、周期变长。这就是很多工厂「加了班、投了料，货还是出不来」的算术原因——瓶颈没变，只是队列变长了。</p>\n<h3 id=\"按节拍投料\">按节拍投料</h3><p>既然排队由投料决定，控制排队的直接手段就是控制投料节奏。节拍时间（takt time）是需求给出的生产节奏：设有净可用工作时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、需求量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T = T_a / D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>，它表示为了满足需求，每多久必须完成一个产品（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Takt_time\">Wikipedia: Takt time</a>）。节拍时间与周期时间不同：前者是<strong>需求要求的速度</strong>，后者是<strong>实际能做的速度</strong>，管理的是两者的差。</p>\n<p>在追单场景里，把投料按瓶颈工序的节拍释放，而不是一次性把所有工单压到车间，能让在制品保持在低位，从而让平均周期接近加工时间。这与约束理论里的「绳子」（rope）机制是同一个思想——投料信号由瓶颈的节奏决定（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Theory_of_constraints\">Wikipedia: Theory of constraints</a>），这一点在第四章的交付机制里展开，见<a href=\"../quickresponse-quality-ops/factory-delivery-commit\">工厂交期承诺与履约率</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"并行准备-把串行改并行\">并行准备：把串行改并行</h2><p>准备时间可压缩的最大来源是<strong>并行化</strong>。传统流程是串行的：确认款 → 订面料 → 面料到厂 → 打样 → 确认 → 排产 → 生产。每一步都等上一步完成。快反流程把其中无强依赖的步骤拆出来并行。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  subgraph 串行流程&#10;    S1[确认款] --&gt; S2[订面料] --&gt; S3[面料到厂] --&gt; S4[打样确认] --&gt; S5[排产]&#10;  end&#10;  subgraph 并行流程&#10;    P1[确认款] --&gt; P2[订面料]&#10;    P1 --&gt; P3[打样确认&lt;br/&gt;用库存同缸样布]&#10;    P2 --&gt; P4[面料到厂]&#10;    P3 --&gt; P5[排产准备&lt;br/&gt;配方/模板/辅料前置]&#10;    P4 --&gt; P6[上线生产]&#10;    P5 --&gt; P6&#10;  end\">graph LR\n  subgraph 串行流程\n    S1[确认款] --&gt; S2[订面料] --&gt; S3[面料到厂] --&gt; S4[打样确认] --&gt; S5[排产]\n  end\n  subgraph 并行流程\n    P1[确认款] --&gt; P2[订面料]\n    P1 --&gt; P3[打样确认&lt;br/&gt;用库存同缸样布]\n    P2 --&gt; P4[面料到厂]\n    P3 --&gt; P5[排产准备&lt;br/&gt;配方/模板/辅料前置]\n    P4 --&gt; P6[上线生产]\n    P5 --&gt; P6\n  end</pre><p>并行化的关键是找到<strong>可以被替代的材料</strong>：打样确认不必等大货面料全部到齐，用同一缸的样布即可完成版型与色差确认；排产准备（配方预置、模板制作、辅料分拣）不必等面料到厂才做，拿到确认样就可以启动。这样一来，「面料在途」这段时间是与其他准备工作重叠的，而不是纯等待。</p>\n<h3 id=\"关键路径决定交期\">关键路径决定交期</h3><p>并行化之后，交期由<strong>关键路径</strong>决定——即最长的那条依赖链。关键路径法的标准计算方式是用前向遍历求最早开始/最早完成、后向遍历求最晚开始/最晚完成，二者的差为总浮动时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TF_i = LS_i - ES_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，浮动为零的活动构成关键路径（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Critical_path_method\">Wikipedia: Critical path method</a>）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ES_i = \\max_{j \\in P(i)} EF_j, \\qquad EF_i = ES_i + D_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6493em;vertical-align:-0.966em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.309em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.966em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TF_i = LS_i - ES_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这条计算对快反的直接指导是：<strong>只压缩关键路径上的活动才能缩短交期</strong>。如果一个活动有正浮动（不在关键路径上），对它加速只是增加了它的空闲时间，总交期不变。很多「全面提速」的努力失败就在这里——资源被摊到了非关键活动上。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>活动</th>\n<th>耗时(天)</th>\n<th>最早完成</th>\n<th>最晚完成</th>\n<th>总浮动</th>\n<th>是否关键</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>面料采购</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>打样确认</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排产准备</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生产加工</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>14</td>\n<td>14</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质检包装</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表说明了为什么压缩「打样确认」意义不大（它有 1 天浮动），而压缩「面料采购」或「生产加工」才有直接效果。它也说明「提前备料」为什么是快反最有效的投入之一——它同时缩短了关键路径上最靠前的那一段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"压缩交期的工程手段汇总\">压缩交期的工程手段汇总</h2><p>把上述机制整理成一份可执行的清单，按投入产出排序：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 交期压缩措施的登记与效果跟踪&#10;CREATE TABLE leadtime_reduction_action (&#10;  id            bigserial PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  factory_id    bigint      NOT NULL,&#10;  action_code   text        NOT NULL,   -- parallel_sample / fabric_prereserve / smed_recipe&#10;                                        -- takt_release / layout_optimize / local_sourcing&#10;  target_activity text      NOT NULL,   -- 作用的活动名（对应关键路径节点）&#10;  expected_days_saved numeric(5,1) NOT NULL,&#10;  actual_days_saved   numeric(5,1),&#10;  applied_at    timestamptz,&#10;  CONSTRAINT no_negative CHECK (expected_days_saved &gt;= 0)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 交期压缩措施的登记与效果跟踪</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> leadtime_reduction_action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigserial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  factory_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  action_code   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- parallel_sample / fabric_prereserve / smed_recipe</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                                        -- takt_release / layout_optimize / local_sourcing</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  target_activity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 作用的活动名（对应关键路径节点）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  expected_days_saved </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  actual_days_saved   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  applied_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> no_negative </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (expected_days_saved </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把每项措施的「预期节省天数」与「实际节省天数」都记录下来，是判断投资是否有效的唯一办法。特别要注意的是：如果某项措施作用在非关键活动上，它的实际节省会显著低于预期——这张表会诚实地暴露这一点，从而把资源引导到真正的关键路径上。</p>\n<h3 id=\"外协工序的时延管理\">外协工序的时延管理</h3><p>快反订单常含外协工序（绣花、水洗），它们会引入额外的流转与排队。外协的时延有两种管理策略：<strong>就近外协</strong>（选地理邻近的合作厂，压缩运输时间但可能牺牲价格）和<strong>并行外协</strong>（后道工序与缝制并行，例如部分裁片先送绣花再回来缝制，而非等整件做好再送）。并行外协的前提是工艺上确实可以切分，这需要工艺工程师参与判断，不能由排产系统单方面决定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>交期由准备、排队、加工、流转四块构成，加工时间常只占 20%–30%，压缩主战场在排产与协同。</li>\n<li>Little&#39;s Law 给出「前置时间 = 在制品 ÷ 产出率」；在制品翻倍会让周期翻倍，但不增加产出。</li>\n<li>按瓶颈节拍投料能压低在制品，从而缩短排队时间。</li>\n<li>并行化的关键是找到可被替代的材料与可提前启动的准备；打样与排产准备不必等面料全部到齐。</li>\n<li>交期由关键路径决定，只有压缩关键路径上的活动才有效，压缩有浮动的活动是浪费。</li>\n<li>交期压缩措施要登记预期与实际节省天数；作用在非关键活动上的措施效果会低于预期。</li>\n<li>外协工序用就近外协与并行外协两条路管理时延，切分方式需工艺判断。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>至此，快反的「速度」问题有了完整解法：触发与数量见<a href=\"hotstyle-chase-reorder\">爆款追单与交期压缩</a>，周期结构见本节，而这一切的起点是最小的首单，见<a href=\"small-batch-sample-quickturn\">小批量打样与快速首单</a>。接下来的第三章处理一个不同的场景——订单不再由平台预测产生，而是由消费者直接下出，见<a href=\"../c2m-order-factory/c2m-order-direct-routing\">C2M 订单直连工厂路由</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"快反周期压缩与并行准备","id":"快反周期压缩与并行准备"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：交期的时间构成","id":"核心概念-交期的时间构成"},{"level":2,"text":"排队时间与在制品","id":"排队时间与在制品"},{"level":3,"text":"按节拍投料","id":"按节拍投料"},{"level":2,"text":"并行准备：把串行改并行","id":"并行准备-把串行改并行"},{"level":3,"text":"关键路径决定交期","id":"关键路径决定交期"},{"level":2,"text":"压缩交期的工程手段汇总","id":"压缩交期的工程手段汇总"},{"level":3,"text":"外协工序的时延管理","id":"外协工序的时延管理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"爆款追单与交期压缩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/agile-quickresponse-supply-chain/small-batch-quick-response/hotstyle-chase-reorder"},"next":{"title":"C2M 订单直连工厂路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/agile-quickresponse-supply-chain/c2m-order-factory/c2m-order-direct-routing"}}